### 5.
Upload Receipt Attachments
For compliance and audit purposes, attach receipts and supporting documents to expense transactions.
Use the [Upload Attachment API](/apis/accounting/reference#operation/attachmentsUpload) directly since file uploads are not supported via the SDK:
```javascript
// Upload receipt after creating expense using HTTP API
