# File Storage Drives API - Unified Drives Integration - Apideck
created: 2020-09-30, last updated: 2026-06-12, [Read more](https://www.apideck.com/file-storage-api/drives)

Standard CRUD operations normalized across all platforms
ListGET
`/drives`
Retrieve all drives with pagination and filtering
GetGET
`/drives/{id}`
Fetch a single drive by ID
CreatePOST
`/drives`
Create a new drive
UpdatePATCH
`/drives/{id}`
Update an existing drive
## Quick Start
...
// List drives from any connected file storage platform
const response = await apideck.file-storage.drivesAll()
// Returns normalized data regardless of the underlying platform
console.log(response.data)
// [
// { id: '123', ...
},
// { id: '456', ...
}
// ]

