## Fields
...
|`serviceId`|*string*|➖|Provide the service id you want to call (e.g., pipedrive).
Only needed when a consumer has activated multiple integrations for a Unified API.|salesforce|
...
|`filter`|components.FilesFilter|➖|Apply filters| |
|`sort`|components.FilesSort|➖|Apply sorting|{ "by": "updated_at", "direction": "desc" }|
|`passThrough`|Record<string, *any*>|➖|Optional unmapped key/values that will be passed through to downstream as query parameters.
Ie: ?pass_through[search]=leads becomes ?search=leads|{ "search": "San Francisco" }|

